*> Acceptance test, the area effect cloud (docs/protocol/44 part 9 section 3, 21 section 8.5; lane 002-lane-mobsb6, T9000): the wait phase, the application beat
*> (tickCount mod 5), the victims map with the reapplication delay, the radius per tick and per use, instant effects at scale 0.5, expiry and the 0.5 minimal radius.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US16-CLOUD.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY PROJSTATE.
 01 WS-PLAYER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PIG-TYPE            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-R                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-PIG                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CLOUD               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEVEL               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TICKS               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DURATION            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-WAIT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-REAPP               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-OWNER               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-SLOW                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-HEALTH-BEFORE       BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "MS-TEST-OPEN" USING WS-PLAYER
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE PL-DIM(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-DIM
     MOVE PL-X(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-X
     MOVE PL-Y(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Y
     MOVE PL-Z(WS-PLAYER) TO WS-Z
     MOVE "minecraft:pig" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-PIG-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     ADD 1 TO WS-X
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-PIG-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PIG
     MOVE 3.0 TO WS-R
     MOVE 600 TO WS-DURATION
     MOVE 10 TO WS-WAIT
     MOVE 20 TO WS-REAPP
     CALL "CLOUD-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-R WS-DURATION WS-WAIT WS-REAPP WS-OWNER WS-CLOUD
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-CLOUD) WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 a cloud is created with kind 3 and radius 3.0" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3003 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = PJ-KIND(WS-SLOT) * 1000 + FUNCTION INTEGER(PJ-RADIUS(WS-SLOT))
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO PJ-FXN(WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 1 TO PJ-FX-ID(WS-SLOT, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PJ-FX-AMP(WS-SLOT, 1)
     MOVE 200 TO PJ-FX-DUR(WS-SLOT, 1)
     MOVE -0.005 TO PJ-RPT(WS-SLOT)
     MOVE -0.5 TO PJ-ROU(WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 1000 TO PJ-SCALE(WS-SLOT)
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 9
         CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "MEF-LEVEL" USING EN-ID(WS-PIG) WS-SLOW WS-LEVEL WS-TICKS
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 no effect is applied during the wait (tick 9 of 10)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     CALL "MEF-LEVEL" USING EN-ID(WS-PIG) WS-SLOW WS-LEVEL WS-TICKS
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 at tick 10 (wait over, 10 mod 5 = 0) the pig gets Slowness I for 200" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1200 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = WS-LEVEL * 1000 + WS-TICKS
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-CLOUD) WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 radius 3 - 0.005 per tick - 0.5 per victim (pig and player) = 1.995" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1995 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = FUNCTION INTEGER(PJ-RADIUS(WS-SLOT) * 1000 + 0.5)
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "EFFECT-LEVEL" USING WS-PLAYER WS-SLOW WS-LEVEL WS-TICKS
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 a player in the cloud gets the effect too" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "MEF-REMOVE" USING EN-ID(WS-PIG) WS-SLOW
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 19
         CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "MEF-LEVEL" USING EN-ID(WS-PIG) WS-SLOW WS-LEVEL WS-TICKS
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 the victim is not hit again before the reapplication delay (tick 29)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     CALL "MEF-LEVEL" USING EN-ID(WS-PIG) WS-SLOW WS-LEVEL WS-TICKS
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 at tick 30 (10 + 20) the victim is hit again" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-LEVEL TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-CLOUD) WS-SLOT
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 radius after tick 30: 3 - 21 x 0.005 - 4 x 0.5 = 0.895" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 895 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = FUNCTION INTEGER(PJ-RADIUS(WS-SLOT) * 1000 + 0.5)
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Instant damage at scale 0.5: amplifier 0 harms int(0.5 x 6 + 0.5) = 3.
     CALL "MEF-REMOVE" USING EN-ID(WS-PIG) WS-SLOW
     MOVE 0 TO WS-WAIT
     CALL "CLOUD-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-R WS-DURATION WS-WAIT WS-REAPP WS-OWNER WS-CLOUD
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-CLOUD) WS-SLOT
     MOVE 1 TO PJ-FXN(WS-SLOT)
     MOVE 6 TO PJ-FX-ID(WS-SLOT, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PJ-FX-AMP(WS-SLOT, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PJ-FX-DUR(WS-SLOT, 1)
     MOVE 1000 TO PJ-SCALE(WS-SLOT)
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-PIG) TO WS-HEALTH-BEFORE
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 5
         CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 instant damage at scale 0.5 hurts the pig by 3" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = WS-HEALTH-BEFORE - EN-HEALTH(WS-PIG)
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Expiry: duration 20, wait 10: gone at tick 30.
     MOVE 20 TO WS-DURATION
     MOVE 10 TO WS-WAIT
     CALL "CLOUD-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-R WS-DURATION WS-WAIT WS-REAPP WS-OWNER WS-CLOUD
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 29
         CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 the cloud still exists at tick 29" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-USED(WS-CLOUD) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 tickCount - wait >= duration at tick 30 discards it" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-USED(WS-CLOUD) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Shrinking below 0.5 discards.
     MOVE 0.6 TO WS-R
     MOVE -1 TO WS-DURATION
     MOVE 0 TO WS-WAIT
     CALL "CLOUD-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-R WS-DURATION WS-WAIT WS-REAPP WS-OWNER WS-CLOUD
     CALL "PJ-FIND" USING EN-ID(WS-CLOUD) WS-SLOT
     MOVE -0.05 TO PJ-RPT(WS-SLOT)
     CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 a radius of exactly 0.5 survives" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-USED(WS-CLOUD) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "CLOUD-STEP" USING WS-CLOUD
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 a radius below 0.5 discards it" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-USED(WS-CLOUD) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   A full state table makes a spawn fail without leaving an entity.
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > PJ-MAX
         MOVE 9999 TO PJ-ENT(WS-I)
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "CLOUD-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-R WS-DURATION WS-WAIT WS-REAPP WS-OWNER WS-CLOUD
     MOVE "acceptance US16 44-9 3 with the state table full no cloud is made (row 0)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-CLOUD TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US16-CLOUD.
 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY MOBSPTEST.
